{-# OPTIONS --guardedness #-}

------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- FourNode liveness M2 — the link-refined `OffersOnly` layer (seam gap
-- (ii)).  `apiLinkAlpha l` confines a tree to events on link `l`; the two
-- bundles of `nodeD` confine to `apiLinkAlpha linkBD` / `apiLinkAlpha
-- linkCD`, disjoint (`linkBD ≢ linkCD`), giving the inner `cong-⦀` of
-- `nodeD ≈DR nodeDSpec` its `Sep ∅ES` side-conditions.  Opens `PipePair`
-- in full to reuse its table `nxt`s/positions/`tableSpec-OffersOnly`/spec
-- peers + the impl-side rename/source `OffersOnly` infrastructure.  The
-- per-spec-peer `x-edge-link`/`xSpec-onLink` block is SCRIPT-GENERATED
-- (`.superpowers/sdd/gen-edge-link.py`; M1 gen-edge-lemmas adapted to the
-- `apiLinkAlpha l` conclusion — identical bodies, the `l′ ≟ l` gate pins
-- `l′ = l` on every firing edge).
------------------------------------------------------------------------

